### 2. How to run / deploy the server

**Local test**
```bash
npm install
node server.js
```
Server runs at `ws://localhost:8080`

**Free cloud deploy (recommended)**  
- Railway.app, Render.com, or Fly.io  
- Connect your GitHub repo  
- It will detect the Node app and give you a public URL like:  
  `wss://crimson-sovereign-xxxx.up.railway.app`

