### Final result
- All players see the same fog/blood levels, player count, and news in real time
- Master broadcasts appear instantly for everyone
- When someone joins or leaves, the count updates live
- Still falls back to your GitHub `config.json` if the WebSocket is temporarily down

Just deploy the `server.js` + `package.json`, put the public `wss://` URL into the client, and you have a fully automatic real-time game server.